    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Welcome to Mythical Party, the thrilling 2D online game where mythical creatures come alive! Battle with/against <u>3-5 players</u> in an epic showdown as  you engage in a captivating clash as mythical bosses inspired by cultures from around the world as courageous raiders.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f0c40758c8e1bd5c21004deeaf948ade.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In each round, one player ascends to the mythical realm as the boss, choosing from a roster of <strong>fearsome</strong> creatures drawn from diverse mythologies called Mythicals. Unleash the power of Mummy's fiery magic, brawl with Kuzenbo's thorny shell &amp; whirling minions or burrow through tunnels and prevent Olgoy Korkoy from surfacing the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/fca1994f0e2de6f0932a1beabb65d360.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The remaining players, known as raiders, must join forces to triumph over the formidable boss. With strategy, and teamwork, raiders aim to defeat the mythical foe before it's too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/97d392031b0cc22b5cba8bb6b50c9292.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every round offers a fresh challenge as a new player assumes the role of the boss. With 3 boss options each time, the variety is endless. Adapt your tactics to face different mythical creatures and discover the strengths and weaknesses of each boss in this dynamic 2D battle for supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/ca275b036e326155bf0105efec9caeeb.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Immerse yourself in the rich tapestry of world cultures as you encounter mythical monsters inspired by legends such as Mummy, Kuzenbo, Olgoy Korkoy and many more bosses to come. Each boss brings a unique flavor to the game, ensuring Mythical Party is a celebration of global folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/95f37bfc44abf2040218b2969db400e0.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/95f37bfc44abf2040218b2969db400e0.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/e84cc7c8a30468ced6b79b11debea6e1.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Winning isn't just about surviving a single round; it's about contributing to the epic saga of the entire game. Parameters like damage dealt, bosses defeated, and landing the first hit determine your success.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/d5f0f62b2dd11a2bf4b2ccff3ea05b84.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Welcome to Mythical Party, the thrilling 2D online game where mythical creatures come alive! Battle with/against <u>3-5 players</u> in an epic showdown as  you engage in a captivating clash as mythical bosses inspired by cultures from around the world as courageous raiders.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f0c40758c8e1bd5c21004deeaf948ade.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/194538642cc8d28ef61b458f9e6c6344.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In each round, one player ascends to the mythical realm as the boss, choosing from a roster of <strong>fearsome</strong> creatures drawn from diverse mythologies called Mythicals. Unleash the power of Mummy's fiery magic, brawl with Kuzenbo's thorny shell &amp; whirling minions or burrow through tunnels and prevent Olgoy Korkoy from surfacing the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/fca1994f0e2de6f0932a1beabb65d360.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/2ed41c85f53a3d544795b6bb7ea0231c.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The remaining players, known as raiders, must join forces to triumph over the formidable boss. With strategy, and teamwork, raiders aim to defeat the mythical foe before it's too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/97d392031b0cc22b5cba8bb6b50c9292.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/f9728e6757573b0dda350981d1dac6f3.mp4?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every round offers a fresh challenge as a new player assumes the role of the boss. With 3 boss options each time, the variety is endless. Adapt your tactics to face different mythical creatures and discover the strengths and weaknesses of each boss in this dynamic 2D battle for supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/ca275b036e326155bf0105efec9caeeb.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Immerse yourself in the rich tapestry of world cultures as you encounter mythical monsters inspired by legends such as Mummy, Kuzenbo, Olgoy Korkoy and many more bosses to come. Each boss brings a unique flavor to the game, ensuring Mythical Party is a celebration of global folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/95f37bfc44abf2040218b2969db400e0.poster.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/95f37bfc44abf2040218b2969db400e0.webm?t=1733147205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773720/extras/e84cc7c8a30468ced6b79b11debea6e1.avif?t=1733147205\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Winning isn't just about surviving a single round; it's about contributing to the epic saga of the entire game. Parameters like damage dealt, bosses defeated, and landing the first hit determine your success.</p>",
